        <body>
            <div xml:id="d567">

                <pb facs="0537" n="467" sameAs="frus:frus1934v04/pg467"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.154/527: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Hanna</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-03-13T11:00:00-06:00">March 13, 1934—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 1:15 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>25. It seems probable that the Central American highway project will come up
                    early in the Conference and it is therefore desirable that <pb facs="0538"
                        n="468" xml:id="pg468"/> I should have the Department’s instructions in this
                    connection as early as practicable.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hanna</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
